{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-4f5ab5fc2a0ebac622b42eb435a6b6f8","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0003","observation_sha256":"b3a94cc92c788f3107da4cec94d303edda7a67b5229b65728c521a91abc240b2","ordinal":3,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"84b3f317b944b9bde4b2b456c8b078b9c3b756357370afad2b7efabc29400e8d","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-4f5ab5fc2a0ebac622b42eb435a6b6f8","key_id":"58fa2a80576d9c092f0e3b88db78eac51cfc2cdaedccd4d9e2ec6e306236f4f0","ordinal":3,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"84b3f317b944b9bde4b2b456c8b078b9c3b756357370afad2b7efabc29400e8d","receipt_mac":"868314eaccb4bfe2a012c9e5af4981f7ad346542c954ac1b1827efba8bb008d9","result_sha256":"210a3963ac35d89dfa17f55daf549ada8285bdb8583bc24dbda30727929559b9","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"cdefb759f83249b7cd5b9fe703c46e5be887ecde0f8a61f33260f2d8a74f6627"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":160,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md","start_line":140},"content":"L140: Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Music really helps with car work. Keeps me focused and makes it feel great. Even though this player is a bit old, he still gets the job done. Check out its photo!\nL141: \nL142: \nL143: [Image caption: a photo of a record player sitting on the floor next to a couch]\nL144: [S28T38] (dia_id: D28:38)\nL145: \nL146: Calvin: Cool, Dave! What tunes are you listening to these days?\nL147: [S28T39] (dia_id: D28:39)\nL148: \nL149: Dave: Lately, I've been getting into classic rock. The music from that era is timeless.\nL150: [S28T40] (dia_id: D28:40)\nL151: \nL152: Calvin: Cool, Dave! Classic rock has had a huge effect on music. Keep discovering!\nL153: [S28T41] (dia_id: D28:41)\nL154: \nL155: Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Classic rock has had a huge impact on music. Always fun to dig in and find new tunes. Gotta go back to work, see you soon! Take care!\nL156: [S28T42] (dia_id: D28:42)\nL157: \nL158: Calvin: Yeah, Dave! Exploring different styles and times can open up new perspectives. Broadening your musical knowledge is awesome. Good luck with work, see ya!\nL159: \nL160: ","content_sha256":"8ed55aca56fc72255f8d635d58aed987aa42a59758ad31da375141be3acb3bbc","coverage":[{"line_end":160,"line_start":140,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":21,"result_sha256":"210a3963ac35d89dfa17f55daf549ada8285bdb8583bc24dbda30727929559b9","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
